#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:3
#: e1ef9c6bde4349f899e8ca04b40e82dd
msgid "有机构象采样（Organic Mol Config）"
msgstr "Organic Molecular Conformation Sampling (Organic Mol Config)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:5
#: 0b8679d900ef402cbd031768485ce5e2
msgid "`Group`: `Organic` | `Class`: `OrganicMolConfigPBCCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:7
#: 7be00c0cdc04483982c4060188f523e8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:9
#: 20f73d75fbfa4bdbb8166b1988808545
msgid ""
"对有机分子体系进行扭转角采样 + "
"高斯局域扰动，生成构象候选用作训练数据。通过键长约束和非键最小距离约束保证输出的化学合理性——不会把构象采样做成断键采样。"
msgstr ""
"Generate training candidates for organic molecular systems by combining "
"torsional sampling with local Gaussian perturbations. Bond-length and "
"nonbonded-distance constraints reject chemically implausible results, "
"keeping conformation sampling distinct from bond-breaking sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:11
#: e3e17c6c08b348d5b7900e3f3c4b9118
msgid ""
"P(\\text{torsion})\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}),\\quad "
"\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2),\\quad \\text{s.t. } "
"d_{\\text{bond}}\\in[f_{\\min}r_0,f_{\\max}r_0],\\ d_{\\text{nonbond}}\\ge "
"f_{\\text{nb}} r_{\\text{vdw}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:13
#: ebb6c1b9bb1c4a8aa3ff825f8754e78f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:15
#: cd21a493df064964879f959c4b154176
msgid "场景：模型在小分子构象变化上的力预测完全不准"
msgstr "Scenario: force predictions fail when a small molecule changes conformation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:17
#: d23bf6d68ed14d8abfc033eae66c4d2a
msgid ""
"你在一个有机分子晶体上训练了一个 NEP 模型，分子内的平衡键长和键角都学得不错。但你把同一个分子旋转一个二面角后，力的 MAE 跳了 4 "
"倍。诊断发现训练集里每个分子只有一种构象——模型不知道扭转角改变时力场该怎么变。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for an organic molecular crystal. It reproduces "
"equilibrium bond lengths and angles, but the force MAE increases fourfold "
"after rotating one dihedral in the same molecule. The training set contains "
"only one conformation per molecule, so the model has no basis for learning "
"how forces change along torsional degrees of freedom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:19
#: c063f3f0d30948838b7f7a9b039754e9
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 有机分子的势能面在二面角方向上是多极值的（如 gauche 和 anti "
"构象）。如果训练集只有一种构象，模型在这个柔性自由度上只能外推。需要系统地对可旋转二面角做采样，并保留那些键长不崩、非键不穿插的构象作为训练样本。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The potential-energy surface of an organic molecule often has"
" multiple minima along a dihedral coordinate, such as gauche and anti "
"conformers. With only one conformation in the training set, the model must "
"extrapolate along that flexible degree of freedom. Sample rotatable "
"dihedrals systematically and retain candidates that preserve bonds and avoid"
" nonbonded overlap."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:21
#: 04b2c858614b4a01b82aa21195b77d4f
msgid "**输入：** 一个有机分子晶体结构，分子拓扑可由程序自动识别"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** An organic molecular-crystal structure whose molecular topology "
"can be inferred automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:23
#: 180ab42da6a5469381bc5d217780ea62
msgid "**目标：** 每帧生成 100 个构象候选，扭转角在 ±60 度内采样，sigma 0.03 的高斯位移"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate 100 conformation candidates per frame, sample torsions "
"within ±60°, and add Gaussian displacements with σ = 0.03 Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:25
#: 7c2572443e0e4ad8a43f4a53d67cc736
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:26
#: 74a701d9b56f430394d3728035e213bf
msgid "`Perturb Per Frame` = `[100]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:27
#: f469fbb3ace64044bbae1189b5b6b554
msgid "`Torsion Range Deg` = `[-60, 60]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:28
#: 61de2e12ed3e4f9a90d61365d4135a9d
msgid "`Max Torsions Per Conf` = `[5]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:29
#: d9c66233e9b148d9b408f595f9cc1fef
msgid "`Gaussian Sigma` = `[0.03]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:30
#: c3551fbbfa60464d9f0f9e91c53c2f44
msgid "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`，`Bond Keep Max Enable` = 勾选"
msgstr "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`; enable `Bond Keep Max Enable`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:32
#: e674e61e8c564ac1973c4a2bfd584815
msgid "**输出：** 最多 100 个构象，带 `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)` 标签"
msgstr "**Output:** Up to 100 conformations labeled `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:34
#: e035db254c634bd2ba31e3bafe8c6279
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:35
#: d553362dbc4247baac65800b44da93c5
msgid "重训后对手动旋转二面角后的测试构型推理，力 MAE 应显著缩小"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, evaluate held-out structures with "
"manually rotated dihedrals; their force MAE should decrease substantially."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:36
#: 7654a9301a3649f2904fc2e9321b4819
msgid "抽查键长分布：输出分子中没有明显短于 `0.6 * r0` 或长于 `1.15 * r0` 的键"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the bond-length distribution. Output molecules should have no bonds "
"appreciably shorter than `0.6 * r0` or longer than `1.15 * r0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:37
#: be5655f2ab984617b03e61144e32fd97
msgid "抽查非键距离：没有不同片段原子重叠（距离 > `0.8 * r_vdw`）"
msgstr ""
"Inspect nonbonded distances and confirm that atoms from different fragments "
"do not overlap; distances should exceed `0.8 * r_vdw`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:38
#: e463ed7ad5a94b0cb62d814e116fbb32
msgid "如果成功率低（< 10%），放宽 `bond_keep_max_factor` 或增大 `max_retries`"
msgstr ""
"If fewer than 10% of candidates are accepted, relax `bond_keep_max_factor` "
"or increase `max_retries`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:40
#: 0cfd90507d1745f79b1c29bcff936a7b
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:42
#: a6dabc04613c4a08a4d672441bf29f44
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:43
#: d8a8119156f54751b655877c2863ba1f
msgid "研究有机分子晶体、聚合物、分子体系的构象空间"
msgstr ""
"You are exploring conformational space in an organic crystal, polymer, or "
"molecular system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:44
#: f6dd581dedc14a30bf01e86d60836eaa
msgid "模型对柔性自由度的预测差（扭转角变化引起力/能量跳变）"
msgstr ""
"The model is inaccurate along flexible degrees of freedom, with force or "
"energy errors changing sharply as torsions rotate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:45
#: 0cfa48e38da446119aadbc8c9e10249e
msgid "需要覆盖分子内多种构象（gauche, anti, eclipsed）"
msgstr ""
"The training set must cover several intramolecular conformers, such as "
"gauche, anti, and eclipsed states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:47
#: 3ec9523e3e5c4c2fb1c4c1416b507088
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:48
#: 3b2a9a8d3ed44df391603c5518734e43
msgid "纯无机体系（没有可旋转二面角）"
msgstr "The system is purely inorganic and has no rotatable dihedrals."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:49
#: 5271cb1b1a144b11906a6506921b09cc
msgid "分子本身是刚性的（如苯环），扭转采样没有意义"
msgstr ""
"The molecule is rigid, such as an isolated benzene ring, so torsional "
"sampling adds no meaningful degree of freedom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:50
#: 45c904cfcb48444a82f49c95a220af64
msgid "只需要坐标扰动 → 用 `Atomic Perturb`"
msgstr "You need only coordinate noise → use `Atomic Perturb`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:52
#: 4d6eff6793f047f89a9f88417573604e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:54
#: 37df631a64c841a8b76004b225874847
msgid "构象采样"
msgstr "Conformation sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:56
#: 5aee7e35f8e14e9392614d2e6ec75fe0
msgid "Perturb Per Frame（perturb_per_frame）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:57
#: 640d40abd5204787a568e5c70fe09780
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100。每个输入帧生成多少个构象候选，20~100 为常规。实际有效输出 = 候选数 x "
"成功率，后面约束越严、保留率越低，产出的结构数可能明显少于候选数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `100`. Number of conformation candidates attempted per input"
" frame; 20–100 is typical. The effective output count is the candidate count"
" multiplied by the acceptance rate. Stricter constraints lower that rate, so"
" the card may return substantially fewer structures than requested."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:59
#: fa45e55eeff3497fa83c891d66b344ae
msgid "Torsion Range Deg（torsion_range_deg）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:60
#: 8de3eefb49134326aeea1406cef07a5d
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`。二面角旋转范围（度），格式 `[最小值, 最大值]`。±30° "
"保守，±180° 全覆盖。范围越大成功率越低，你需要权衡覆盖面和出产率。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default: `(-180.0, 180.0)`. Dihedral rotation range "
"in degrees, expressed as `[minimum, maximum]`. ±30° is conservative; ±180° "
"spans the full angular range. Wider scans typically reduce acceptance, so "
"balance coverage against yield."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:62
#: 198c48091acc4ad3a5453b66b32e3e53
msgid "Max Torsions Per Conf（max_torsions_per_conf）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:63
#: 336d336a296c4eb8a0f515ef6eb8fba5
msgid "`int`，默认 50。每个构象最多旋转几个二面角，常规 1~5。设越多构象越复杂、成功率越低，建议从 3 起步试探。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `50`. Maximum number of dihedrals rotated in one candidate. "
"A practical range is 1–5. Rotating more dihedrals creates more complex "
"conformations and lowers acceptance; start with 3 when tuning a new system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:65
#: d8e1997423d9474c953ed6ddb83c2cb0
msgid "Gaussian Sigma（gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:66
#: 79924bd1b7774defb4ec2801d3c55fa7
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03 Å。局域高斯扰动的标准差，常规 0.01~0.03。数值越大原子偏移越剧烈。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.03` Å. Standard deviation of the local Gaussian "
"displacement. A typical range is 0.01–0.03 Å; larger values produce stronger"
" coordinate perturbations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:68
#: c9fd4f03a63347ec8014a4a0684635f7
msgid "Max Retries（max_retries）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:69
#: 26bca49e556b481e994cf17aebbf2863
msgid "`int`，默认 12。每个构象候选在约束失败后的最大重试次数。增大能提高成功率但线性增加耗时——设到 20 以上时先检查是不是约束太严了。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `12`. Maximum retries after a candidate fails the "
"constraints. Increasing it can improve yield but raises cost linearly. "
"Before using more than 20 retries, check whether the constraints themselves "
"are unnecessarily strict."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:71
#: add0008bc29442f6b58bd5862127df54
msgid "PBC 和局部环境"
msgstr "Periodic boundaries and local environment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:73
#: 4550f437ac314be398d84c5976f91473
msgid "PBC Mode（pbc_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:74
#: 527acf4268694b8fbbaea7dffd456274
msgid "`str`，默认 `'auto'`。构象扰动时的周期边界处理方式，可选 `auto` / `pbc` / `nonpbc`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'auto'`. Periodic-boundary treatment during conformation "
"perturbation. Choices are `auto`, `pbc`, and `nonpbc`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:76
#: 45200999bdfc4f3bba133f2267bb95b8
msgid "Local Cutoff（local_cutoff）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:77
#: 57a2821b55ee437db370c9e94e7ab40f
msgid "`int`，默认 200。局部构象扰动的影响范围。小 cutoff 更局域，大 cutoff 会带动更大分子片段一起动——柔性链或配体适合调大。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `200`. Spatial extent of a local conformational "
"perturbation. A smaller cutoff localizes the change; a larger cutoff moves a"
" larger molecular fragment and may be appropriate for flexible chains or "
"ligands."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:79
#: 725da59205c340be9049bf794590cee2
msgid "Local Subtree（local_subtree）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:80
#: 6751c823b70f4fea81eb15537ca2453a
msgid "`int`，默认 100。打开后扭转沿分子拓扑传播到子树，适合真实单键旋转；关掉时更像纯局部坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `100`. When enabled, a torsion propagates through the "
"molecular-topology subtree, as expected for rotation about a real single "
"bond. When disabled, the operation behaves more like local coordinate noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:82
#: 955691e3c8914133bbfe5b7bd858a0ce
msgid "Nonpbc Box Size（nonpbc_box_size）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:83
#: cf21d63c947e439880496d01749dc343
msgid "`float`，默认 100.0 Å。非周期分子包围盒尺寸。盒子太小会制造假镜像接触，太大只增加体积相关过滤风险。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `100.0` Å. Bounding-box size for a nonperiodic molecule. A"
" box that is too small creates artificial image contacts; an excessively "
"large box can interact poorly with volume-based filters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:85
#: 56971e69cf8444b885118a3fe4e106d0
msgid "键识别和键长约束"
msgstr "Bond detection and bond-length constraints"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:87
#: de291db5847a4862815d2de1e224d8be
msgid "Bond Detect Factor（bond_detect_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:88
#: 37224cb3964049e5a8da17b22ad9d917
msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。成键检测因子，数值越大越容易把较远的原子对判定为成键。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `1.15`. Bond-detection factor. Larger values make more "
"distant atom pairs likely to be classified as bonded."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:90
#: de772fcb16ff46df862fdf27d1c52035
msgid "Bond Keep Min Factor（bond_keep_min_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:91
#: df1ca6d4b73649f399dd715489b846e9
msgid "`float`，默认 0.6。允许的最短键长 = `factor * r0`（r0 为平衡键长）。设太小会放过断键结构，设太大又可能拒绝略压缩的合理构象。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.6`. Minimum allowed bond length, `factor * r0`, where "
"`r0` is the reference bond length. A value that is too small admits broken "
"or collapsed geometries; one that is too large rejects reasonably compressed"
" conformations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:93
#: 76c1fe53899d4badaefa67ac75c340ee
msgid "Bond Keep Max Factor（bond_keep_max_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:94
#: 2b7c314b73964b3993928eff3e60d715
msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。允许的最长键长上限系数。值太小会拒绝合理的柔性拉伸构象，太大又可能放过实质断键的结构。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `1.15`. Maximum bond-length factor. Too small a value "
"rejects legitimate flexible stretching; too large a value can admit "
"effectively broken bonds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:96
#: f72ccb76b03d47e7b8a5d7eb133405f2
msgid "Bond Keep Max Enable（bond_keep_max_enable）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:97
#: 13c9b3e42fdf414cabeff7ed5195e3d2
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"false。打开后才启用键长上限检查。当你需要严格保护分子内键不被拉伸时打开；但如果体系本身含软键或反应路径，打开反而会误删高能但有意义的构型。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enables the maximum bond-length check. Use it when"
" intramolecular bonds must remain intact. For systems with soft bonds or "
"reactive pathways, it may reject high-energy but scientifically relevant "
"configurations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:99
#: 53fe3dc54ecc4100941547ef58cbc682
msgid "Mult Bond Factor（mult_bond_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:100
#: a2d0fdb7089e4a4391623b37741b5b68
msgid "`float`，默认 0.87。多重键（C=C、C=O、芳香环等）的识别系数。含这些键的体系需要用它限制扭转自由度；纯单键柔性分子影响很小。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.87`. Detection factor for multiple bonds such as C=C, "
"C=O, and aromatic bonds. It restricts torsional freedom in systems "
"containing such bonds and has little effect on molecules dominated by "
"flexible single bonds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:102
#: 89788354f5904969a6c61ce24ef2fb2c
msgid "BO C Const（bo_c_const）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:103
#: 14a5debbafc04a75a4efded89bf17054
msgid "`float`，默认 0.3。键级估计的衰减常数，影响哪些键被当成强键保护。除非你在调试键识别，保持默认就好。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.3`. Decay constant used in bond-order estimation and "
"therefore in deciding which bonds receive strong protection. Keep the "
"default unless you are diagnosing bond detection."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:105
#: 83948fe5a5954a1eaa49c599a2c0f261
msgid "BO Threshold（bo_threshold）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:106
#: 7e8dbfb65243441e8cebafb764b936b9
msgid "`float`，默认 0.2。化学键保留的键级阈值。阈值越高，只有更强的键被识别和保护；阈值越低，更多弱相互作用被当成键，可能过度限制构象自由度。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.2`. Bond-order threshold for preserving chemical bonds."
" Raising it protects only stronger bonds; lowering it classifies more weak "
"interactions as bonds and may overconstrain conformational freedom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:108
#: a7c898ca6fe44b49ae0a5d2c35df22aa
msgid "非键约束"
msgstr "Nonbonded constraints"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:110
#: 6ba53fa41af74567b3cd5d0c1783773b
msgid "Nonbond Min Factor（nonbond_min_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:111
#: 672fd2bf8450497db65cf517b8d5a05a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子允许的最近距离 = `factor * r_vdw`（r_vdw 为范德华半径）。发现原子穿插时调大到 "
"0.9~1.0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.8`. Minimum nonbonded distance, `factor * r_vdw`, where"
" `r_vdw` is the van der Waals reference distance used by the implementation."
" Increase this to 0.9–1.0 if atoms interpenetrate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:113
#: 7ffc301e03a14b6f8a3b6daab7b83a23
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:115
#: e731f0c73cea45fab822e6c4a98ee512
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:116
#: ef8d08fe2723430aa0f978a5af46e0ba
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开 + 固定 seed 后同参数同输入可复现。种子与结构的稳定 ID 联合影响采样路径。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducible sampling"
" from the same input and parameters. The seed and the structure's stable ID "
"jointly determine the sampling path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:118
#: 5ea927b21bae4bd7967943b9f7d03612
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:119
#: 58966c0979d942408d9de16d252b9d21
msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。仅 `use_seed` 打开时生效，两个不同 seed 产生两组不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `0`. Fixed random seed used only when `use_seed` is enabled."
" Different seeds produce different torsion angles and perturbation "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:121
#: 18f077cc7e0240baae6254986f1a39fb
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

