#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:206
#: 8451e01e26c043a496bd9d410c2191ef
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:208
#: f98c3556cf4e41b8a5075e92cf6bd5f2
msgid "`Organic Mol Config` → `Atomic Perturb`：先做构象主采样，再加轻度热噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Organic Mol Config` → `Atomic Perturb`: sample the main conformational "
"degrees of freedom, then add mild thermal-like noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:209
#: 5de9c62c7feb4e9b9ae0177c00b632e3
msgid "`Organic Mol Config` → `FPS Filter`：大批量生成后做代表性筛选"
msgstr ""
"`Organic Mol Config` → `FPS Filter`: select representative structures after "
"large-scale generation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:210
#: f89ccce069994c1b811ad19d4750063e
msgid "对有机体系后筛时，优先看键长、非键距离和拓扑保持情况"
msgstr ""
"When filtering an organic system, prioritize bond lengths, nonbonded "
"distances, and topology preservation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:212
#: a30cac8b73904b1b8c6fef848e622e13
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:214
#: aeaf8ef1c2bc4f488cc38c9543957bab
msgid ""
"**输出成功率很低（<10%）。** 约束太严或者扭转范围太大导致大部分候选被拒绝。先收窄 `torsion_range_deg`，增大 "
"`max_retries`，放宽 `bond_keep_max_factor`。"
msgstr ""
"**The acceptance rate is below 10%.** Most candidates are being rejected "
"because the constraints are too strict or the torsion range is too wide. "
"First narrow `torsion_range_deg`, then increase `max_retries` or relax "
"`bond_keep_max_factor` as justified by the chemistry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:216
#: 1fba9173f49743e686fd623456c0a3fb
msgid ""
"**键被拉断了。** `bond_keep_max_enable` 没开，或者 `bond_keep_max_factor` "
"太大。开启该约束并设定合理上限。"
msgstr ""
"**Bonds are being stretched to the point of breaking.** "
"`bond_keep_max_enable` is disabled or `bond_keep_max_factor` is too large. "
"Enable the upper bond-length constraint and choose a chemically defensible "
"limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:218
#: 682b0a2814bf49258179dab435ebcd0b
msgid "**非键原子穿插。** `nonbond_min_factor` 太小。增大到 0.9~1.0。"
msgstr "**Nonbonded atoms interpenetrate.** Increase `nonbond_min_factor` to 0.9–1.0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:220
#: b8df3dc25780433287c97683c9f64be9
msgid "**扭转角采样没有效果。** 确认分子中存在可旋转的单键。刚性环分子没有可旋转二面角。"
msgstr ""
"**Torsional sampling has no visible effect.** Confirm that the molecule "
"contains a rotatable single bond. A rigid ring has no freely rotatable "
"dihedral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:222
#: 8ed680a659604475b7da1866be858b89
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:224
#: 0d8bf9121b8046d9bcfb77d7d46b86aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`TG(n={候选数},sig={sigma},pbc={模式})`"
msgstr "`TG(n={candidate count},sig={sigma},pbc={mode})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:226
#: 31054cfb6c8941c5ab15a4062eabbcfd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:228
#: 3475b24b4f554179b5e442466bad0ce7
msgid ""
"勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。构象生成受 seed + 结构稳定 ID 联合控制，不同 seed "
"产生不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the result for the same input."
" Conformation generation is controlled jointly by the seed and the "
"structure's stable ID; different seeds produce different torsions and "
"perturbation directions."
